ers/web-flow/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"parents":[{"sha":"5a97247bf6ad10485d8891db5430b9e34def4933","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/the-omega-institute/trureturing/commits/5a97247bf6ad10485d8891db5430b9e34def4933","html_url":"https://github.com/the-omega-institute/trureturing/commit/5a97247bf6ad10485d8891db5430b9e34def4933"}],"stats":{"total":51,"additions":51,"deletions":0},"files":[{"sha":"bdec7d1dbca9c927dc1958deafd546a5cbfba1b0","filename":"docs/develop/theory/QUANTUM_REALITY_FOUR_PATH_FULL_RECORD_RECOVERY_BOUND_CONTINUATION_IV.md","status":"modified","additions":51,"deletions":0,"changes":51,"blob_url":"https://github.com/the-omega-institute/trureturing/blob/bff0276bdd99004a6c0549292f9c57301085af12/docs%2Fdevelop%2Ftheory%2FQUANTUM_REALITY_FOUR_PATH_FULL_RECORD_RECOVERY_BOUND_CONTINUATION_IV.md","raw_url":"https://github.com/the-omega-institute/trureturing/raw/bff0276bdd99004a6c0549292f9c57301085af12/docs%2Fdevelop%2Ftheory%2FQUANTUM_REALITY_FOUR_PATH_FULL_RECORD_RECOVERY_BOUND_CONTINUATION_IV.md","contents_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/the-omega-institute/trureturing/contents/docs%2Fdevelop%2Ftheory%2FQUANTUM_REALITY_FOUR_PATH_FULL_RECORD_RECOVERY_BOUND_CONTINUATION_IV.md?ref=bff0276bdd99004a6c0549292f9c57301085af12","patch":"@@ -4168,3 +4168,54 @@ $\\Gamma_-$ 的定量上界；连续性、局部点、放松椭圆和固定损失\n 并把中段残差推进为全区间严格有理余量。它只依赖前文的完整原始三角域、\n 固定标签、同一反馈、普通转置和非负根支；不把数值优化、放松椭圆或单点\n 反例当作全域证明，也不声称决定更大的 $A_-(13/4)>A_+(13/4)$ 比较。\n+\n+## 62. 中央尾段的严格负地板延展\n+\n+**定理 62.1（中央尾段严格地板）。** 保持定义 57.1 的负号行、固定标签、同一反馈、普通转置、非负根支及完整三角域。对\n+\\[\n+ q\\in\\left[\\frac{599}{1000},\\frac35\\right]\n+ \\quad\\text{及全部 }(X,Y)\\in\\mathcal T_x\n+\\]\n+都有\n+\\[\n+ \\boxed{G_-(q,X,Y)>\\frac{23}{50}.}\n+ \\tag{62.1}\n+\\]\n+\n+*证明。* 定理 58.1 给出全三角域的严格下界\n+\\[\n+ G_-(q,X,Y)>\\phi(q):=-\\frac{333}{50}+\\frac{29}{5}q\n+ +\\frac{1651}{1000}\\left(\\frac{19}{16}+\\frac q2\\right)^2.\n+ \\tag{62.2}\n+\\]\n+直接整理得\n+\\[\n+ \\phi(q)-\\frac{23}{50}\n+ =\\frac{P(q)}{256000},\n+ \\qquad\n+ P(q)=105664q^2+1986704q-1226709.\n+ \\tag{62.3}\n+\\]\n+而\n+\\[\n+ P'(q)=211328q+1986704>0\n+ \\quad(q\\ge0),\n+ \\tag{62.4}\n+\\]\n+并且\n+\\[\n+ P\\!\\left(\\frac{599}{1000}\\right)\n+ =\\frac{19360076}{15625}>0.\n+ \\tag{62.5}\n+\\]\n+所以 $P(q)>0$ 对给定区间成立，结合 (62.2) 即得 (62.1)。\\hfill$\\square$\n+\n+**定义 62.2（中央残差的当前边界）。** 定理 62.1 严格排除注册中段的尾部\n+\\[\n+ \\left[\\frac{599}{1000},\\frac35\\right]\n+\\]\n+，并保留完整三角域及所有边界量词。它没有处理\n+\\[\n+ \\left(\\frac{3}{50},\\frac{599}{1000}\\right)，\n+\\]\n+也没有为该区间构造 $G_-\\le23/50$ 的可达到反例；因此中心比较问题仍在上述中段保持 unresolved。"}]}